.PP
\fBUNSAFE_SUB_UID_DETERMINISTIC_WRAP\fR (boolean)
.RS 4
\fB WARNING: SECURITY RISK \- MAY CAUSE RANGE OVERLAPS AND PRIVILEGE ESCALATION! \fR
